.",[224,225,227],"h2",{"id":226},"_1-erstes-konto-manuell-erstellen","1. Erstes Konto manuell erstellen",[220,229,230],{},"Falls noch kein Konto existiert, erstellen Sie das erste Konto direkt in der Datenbank:",[232,233,234,257,463,466],"ol",{},[235,236,237,238,242,243,250,251,256],"li",{},"Öffnen Sie Ihr MySQL-Verwaltungstool oder Datenbank-UI, zum Beispiel ",[239,240,241],"code",{},"mysql",", ",[244,245,249],"a",{"href":246,"rel":247},"https:\u002F\u002Fdbeaver.io\u002F",[248],"nofollow","DBeaver"," oder ",[244,252,255],{"href":253,"rel":254},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.phpmyadmin.net\u002F",[248],"PHPMyAdmin",", und verbinden Sie sich mit der Datenbank, die von FiveNet oder Ihrem Gameserver verwendet wird.",[235,258,259,260,263,264,345,355,358,361],{},"Navigieren Sie zur Tabelle ",[239,261,262],{},"fivenet_accounts"," und erstellen Sie einen neuen Eintrag mit den folgenden Werten:",[265,266,267,280],"table",{},[268,269,270],"thead",{},[271,272,273,277],"tr",{},[274,275,276],"th",{},"Feld",[274,278,279],{},"Beschreibung des Werts",[281,282,283,298,321,331],"tbody",{},[271,284,285,291],{},[286,287,288],"td",{},[239,289,290],{},"enabled",[286,292,293,294,297],{},"Auf ",[239,295,296],{},"1"," setzen, um das Konto zu aktivieren.",[271,299,300,305],{},[286,301,302],{},[239,303,304],{},"license",[286,306,307,308,242,311,242,314,242,317,320],{},"Ihre In-Game-Kennung\u002FLizenz ohne Präfix (z.B. ",[239,309,310],{},"char*:",[239,312,313],{},"license:",[239,315,316],{},"steam:",[239,318,319],{},"discord:",").",[271,322,323,328],{},[286,324,325],{},[239,326,327],{},"reg_token",[286,329,330],{},"Ein 6-stelliger Registrierungstoken für die Kontoerstellung.",[271,332,333,338],{},[286,334,335],{},[239,336,337],{},"groups",[286,339,340,341,344],{},"Ein JSON-String-Array, z. B. ",[239,342,343],{},"[\"admin\"]"," (Liste von Gruppen).",[346,347,348],"blockquote",{},[220,349,350,354],{},[351,352,353],"strong",{},"Hinweis:"," Lassen Sie alle anderen Felder unverändert.",[356,357],"br",{}